  "frontier_coordinate": "R-128 resolves the fixed-chart owner-incidence and force-definition ambiguities left after R-127. Differentiating the exact recombined R-104 renormalized-interaction identity gives the legal control covector and common owner Hessian, with fixed bounded linear refinement conjugacy; R-119 already owns the abstract control-Hessian factorisation. Bounded smooth fixtures separate control shifts from Malliavin source derivatives and retain both feedback Jacobian and connection terms. The complete R-125 covariance-normal force is (g_V-g_T)/2, so the naked R-126 trace-excess force is incomplete; sextic and source-cost derivatives must also be present under their declared endpoint/action convention. Rootwise adaptation does not prove the R-079 common terminal, and one-sided spatial projection does not make the geometric reverse an adjoint. The half-debt R-103 calculation leaves scalar margin 0.0239601163... only after adverse diagonal debts are absorbed, and full force completion cannot be combined with a second full Hessian payment from the same source square. The live successor is A13-CLASSII-PRODUCTION-AUGMENTED-SOURCE-HESSIAN-UNIFORM-SCHUR-GAP: prove two-sided corrected covariance-normal root/shell blocks, balanced/rational/Cartan/forest bounds, the full diagonal/off-diagonal Loewner margin and low Douglas loss, the absolute anchor, and the common-terminal/matching-trace bridge uniformly. R-127, R-126, R-125, R-121, R-120, R-119, R-103 REG, and R-087/R-093 CORE retain their owners. OVERLAP_src, Nelson, removals, interacting measure, and Sector A remain open.",
